  "description": "Redis backend for Cirreum.Coordination — distributed, multi-instance atomic coordination. Implements IReplayGuard (atomic SET NX claim for replay / nonce protection) and IRequestThrottle (atomic Lua fixed-window counter for rate limiting) over an application-provided StackExchange.Redis IConnectionMultiplexer. The adapter is blind to connection configuration, sharing the same connection the rest of your app uses, and coordinates across every instance sharing the connection.",
